	"system": {
		"description": "<p>With practice, incredible shots can be made with apparent ease. When you activate this maneuver, you take the Attack action and make a ranged weapon attack, as well as any additional attacks granted by Extra Attack. When making that first ranged attack, roll 2d20. 3d20 if you have advantage or disadvantage. If both dice, or at least two dice, would result in a hit on your target you instead land a critical hit.</p>",
